---
// src/components/sections/about/QualityCommitment.astro
---

<section class="border-border bg-surface relative border-t py-20 lg:py-32">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[96rem] px-6 lg:px-12">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="reveal max-w-3xl">
      <span
        class="text-accent mb-3 block text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.3em] uppercase sm:text-sm"
      >
        Komitmen Kualitas
      </span>
      <h2
        class="font-heading text-primary text-4xl leading-tight font-normal uppercase sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl"
      >
        Standar Kesegaran & Pengiriman Khusus
      </h2>
      <p
        class="text-secondary/80 mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed font-light sm:text-lg"
      >
        Menjaga keindahan alami bunga dari ruang kontrol suhu atelier hingga
        tiba sempurna di tangan penerima.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 3 Pillars Grid -->
    <div class="mt-16 grid grid-cols-1 gap-10 md:grid-cols-3 lg:gap-12">
      <div
        class="reveal border-border bg-surface-card border p-8 shadow-xs transition-transform duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 sm:p-10"
      >
        <span class="font-heading text-accent text-3xl font-bold">01</span>
        <h3
          class="font-heading text-primary mt-6 text-xl font-bold tracking-wide uppercase"
        >
          Kontrol Suhu Presisi
        </h3>
        <p class="text-secondary/75 mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed sm:text-base">
          Setiap tangkai bunga disimpan dalam cold-room khusus beriklim stabil
          untuk menjaga kesegaran dan mahkota bunga melar secara alami.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div
        class="reveal border-border bg-surface-card border p-8 shadow-xs transition-transform delay-150 duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 sm:p-10"
      >
        <span class="font-heading text-accent text-3xl font-bold">02</span>
        <h3
          class="font-heading text-primary mt-6 text-xl font-bold tracking-wide uppercase"
        >
          Pengiriman Mobil Berpendingin
        </h3>
        <p class="text-secondary/75 mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed sm:text-base">
          Armada pengiriman khusus yang dilengkapi pengatur suhu otomatis guna
          menghindari kerusakan akibat panas cuaca tropis.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div
        class="reveal border-border bg-surface-card border p-8 shadow-xs transition-transform delay-300 duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 sm:p-10"
      >
        <span class="font-heading text-accent text-3xl font-bold">03</span>
        <h3
          class="font-heading text-primary mt-6 text-xl font-bold tracking-wide uppercase"
        >
          Garansi Kesegaran 100%
        </h3>
        <p class="text-secondary/75 mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed sm:text-base">
          Kami menjamin kelayakan dan kesegaran kondisi rangkaian bunga hingga
          saat tiba di lokasi tujuan pengiriman.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
